  "contracts": [
    "True CardModel.CurrentUpgradeLevel is limited by MaxUpgradeLevel; Wither increases a separate fake counter",
    "Enchantments and afflictions each occupy one source slot with actual Amount",
    "Energy base/local/final costs and ordered expiry are distinct",
    "Glass has a private raw accumulator; Dark EvokeVal is already its raw accumulator",
    "Run and player ToSerializable expose persistent seed/counters without drawing RNG",
    "EventModel.Rng is retained by the bridge across event completion for its final counter",
    "Mutable event Description/current values differ from canonical event data",
    "Treasure state GET must not invoke OpenChest; explicit chest action triggers source rewards",
    "Private prepared treasure relics remain hidden before collection opens",
    "Relic DisplayAmount is distinct from stored Amount/counters; saved properties exported under validation only",
    "Policy input must not receive validation RNG, odds or native hidden draw order",
    "RunState.ActFloor is the per-act entered-room counter; TotalFloor is cumulative map history",
    "Card reward alternatives retain source option identities and AfterSelected behavior; Skip is not the first arbitrary button",
    "Observed relic runtime fields are explicit primitive counters/booleans derived from prior owned actions, not oracle RNG or future choices",
    "Owned DamageReceived history keeps per-player TurnNumber stamps, actual HP-loss sums/counts and independent !WasFullyBlocked counts",
    "EmotionChip checks !WasFullyBlocked in the prior player span, which can include zero-HP-loss or Buffer-prevented results",
    "Potion popup disables both use and discard when CanRemovePotions is false; queued or dead-owner potions cannot be removed",
    "AnyTime potion usage is distinct from CombatOnly player-phase/card-selection restrictions; custom usability and target validity are observed explicitly",
    "Ordinary reward rows expose source selector CanSkip/CanReroll flags without generating alternatives or revealing prepared cards; SpecialCardReward has no ordinary selector",
    "AttackIntent.DamageCalc provides the current selected move raw base; GetSingleDamage applies all hooks and truncates before displaying the label",
    "Crystal Sphere exports numeric remaining divinations and completed reveal history; partial cells do not expose full hidden item bounds",
    "Additional owned periodic histories and Wongo payout state are source primitive fields, independent of transient display animations",
    "EventOption.WasChosen records every successful callback entry; DisableOnChosen=false permits repeated choices after a canceled confirmation, including Trial DoubleDown and Architect Proceed",
    "Trial DoubleDown opens the owned NAbandonRunConfirmPopup in NModalContainer; its visible enabled Yes/No controls take priority over underlying rooms, and explicit commands invoke the actual confirmation callbacks"
  ],
  "compiled_against_game": false,
  "installed_game_behavior_validated": false,
